Subject: [PATCH] core: retain a prepaid finite Controller recipient range

The explicit provider range remains inside the original recovery reserve.
PID1 consumes each ordinal before clone and keeps native attempt custody;
physical terminal observation does not reset the parent's cumulative charge.
Other service launch grammars retain their existing closed native engines.

